{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーリングは苦手だけどスキーは得意になった。ジョンソンです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のボーリングやってる姿が気持ち悪くて笑った。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰か〜コツ教えて〜\nもっとかっこ良く投げたい。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見て！チューリップポーズやってもらったの(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/14/2237722/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人ともかわいい(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラがまわってないときに結構ガチめの雪合戦して遊んでもらったよ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと小峠さんにゴキブリの裏話を教えてもらった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒にお仕事出来るといいなー(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/14/2237722/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埋められた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやに「春になるまで埋まってろ❤️」って言われた！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やられた❤️！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/14/2237722/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキーらぶ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッピーバレンタインだよ❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/14/2237722/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天で作ったガトーショコラ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか上手でしょψ(｀∇´)ψ\n今年は料女子目指すし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は京都でアルバムの個別握手！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を着るかは...決まってるんだ〜❤️❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの予想はあたるかなー(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/14/2237722/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみやー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃ今日は短いけど\n明日に備えて寝まーす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/02/14/2237722/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたん、だーいすき"}],"source":"archive"}